# DESK09 -- cnx_put through `Options -> Save desktop`, on the kernel desktop
# (sd-base, no #Z). At boot the C:\ window stands at the staggered default
# (48,43,544,400); ticks are 200 Hz after "[desk] desktop up" armed the
# injector.
# A: idle.
# Drag the title bar from (300,52) to (400,150): the frame moves by (+100,+98),
#    `do_xyfix` aligns x to 16 -> (144,141,544,400). -> B
# Hover the Options title (x 160..232, A100/A102: titles start at 16) -> C, the
#    box open, so the item row can be read off the picture.
# Click "Save desktop..." -- entry 11 of the Options box, 16 px per row below
#    the 19 px bar: y = 19 + 11*16 = 195..211, centre 203. -> D
200 parkbr
1000 arm
1100 mark A_IDLE
1400 move 300 52
1600 down
1650 drag 400 150
1800 up
2000 parkbr
2400 mark B_MOVED
2700 move 196 8
3100 mark C_OPTIONS_OPEN
3400 move 200 203
3600 down
3603 up
3900 parkbr
4300 mark D_SAVED
